 38+  81A2              ; CRtoSCREEN - Converts a scr char coord into a SCREEN Address   b,c = y,x positions
 39+  81A2              ;	IN  - B=Row, C=Column
 40+  81A2              ;	OUT - HL=Address in screen also stored in (SCR_CUR_PTR)
